# touch(1)

## NAME

touch - change file times or create files

## SYNOPSIS

    touch [-c] file...

## DESCRIPTION

Sets the times of each file to now. A file that does not exist is created empty.

## OPTIONS

- `-c`: do not create files

## EXIT STATUS

- `0`: success
- `1`: an error occurred for some operand
- `2`: usage error

## SEE ALSO

ls(1)
